The model in this folder (mobilenet_v2.bin, mobilenet_v2.json) is the
MobileNetV2 NSFW classifier shipped in the npm package nsfwjs 4.3.0
(https://github.com/infinitered/nsfwjs), trained by the nsfw_model project
(https://github.com/GantMan/nsfw_model). Guardian stores its original
uint8-quantized weights unchanged; only the container format was converted.
Both projects are MIT-licensed:

